#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#The purpose of this example is to demonstrate the use of a synthesized cross slope sine sweep road to excite the ride dynamics of a vehicle.
#
#This example shows a small utility truck with three payloads represented as barrels added to the bed.
#
#This vehicle also uses the Pacejka 5.2 tire model option.
#
#You can use the plots and animation to analyze the results of this test to study and understand the effects this type of road has on the tire and damper forces, suspension behavior, etc.
